{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"getUserId","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current user identifier (custom user ID or HWID)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the user ID that was previously set via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"type":"text","text":", or the HWID if no custom"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"user ID has been set."}]},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync user ID with analytics platforms:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class AnalyticsCoordinator {","","    func syncIdentifiers() {","        let userId = Pushwoosh.configure.getUserId()","        let hwid = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","","        \/\/ Sync with various analytics platforms","        Analytics.identify(userId)","        Crashlytics.setUserID(userId)","        MixpanelInstance.identify(distinctId: userId)","","        \/\/ Log device mapping for debugging","        Logger.debug(\"User identity: userId=\\(userId), hwid=\\(hwid)\")","    }","","    func trackEventWithUserContext(_ event: String, properties: [String: Any]) {","        var enrichedProperties = properties","        enrichedProperties[\"pushwoosh_user_id\"] = Pushwoosh.configure.getUserId()","        enrichedProperties[\"pushwoosh_hwid\"] = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","","        Analytics.track(event, properties: enrichedProperties)","    }","}"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/getuserid"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Retrieves the current user identifier.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/getUserId"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"getUserId"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)getUserId","symbolKind":"method","title":"getUserId","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"getUserId"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/getUserId":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Retrieves the current user identifier.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/getUserId","title":"getUserId","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getUserId","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"getUserId","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/getuserid"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[